OL,3,GNEWSA'Multiple searches' after four
OL,4,Aarson attack murders
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey said "multiple searches" were
OL,7,Fconducted on Tuesday evening and a
OL,8,Fnumber of vehicles and electronic
OL,9,Fdevices have been seized for technical
OL,10,Fexamination.
